th.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T13:38:06-08:00","id":1292593,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm.... Ok, the fact that this counts as Thaumaturgy is interesting and causes me to reconceptualize how I think about it. Before I viewed it as a sort of ability to perform minor miracles, which would be distinct from the sort of learned skill that would be needed when doing geomancy or alchemy.<br /> <br /> However, if tuning a geomantic array to trigger an essence buildup is Thaumaturgy, then it\u2019s starting to feel more like Thaumaturgy is a kind of basic attunement to essence, which lets you feel what the necessary \u201cfinal step\u201d is in these rituals. You can look at the rods and some part of you knows that they need to be extended an inch and rotated 5 degrees today but next week they\u2019ll need you to hang a crystal in there. Or that, in this place, the bread needs to be torn this way for it to magically multiply.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s sort of like making a Shamble, I guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T14:37:23-08:00","id":1292609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Or